<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Jan-Feb net 506 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan-Feb net 506 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's federally owned telecommunications giant Telecomunicacoes Brasileiras S.A. (Telebras) released the following preliminary financial results for January and February.</p>
<p>			  Jan-Feb 1997	   Jan-Feb 1996</p>
<p>Consolidated Net     506 million		   N/A</p>
<p>Gross Oper Revs    2.991 bln		   N/A</p>
<p>Net Oper Revs	2.281 bln		   N/A</p>
<p>Holding Net	    605 million		   N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais and not adjusted for inflation. No comparative two-month results for 1996 were given.</p>
<p>Telebras, the bellwether Brazilian stock, is traded in New York as a level three American Depositary Receipt.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
